                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">In a certain code language, ‘POLISH’ is written as ‘89’ and ‘CLIP’ is written as ‘72’. How will ‘CONTROL’ be written in that language? </td>",
