                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">In this question, two statements I and II have been given. These statements may be independent causes or effects of independent causes or a common cause. One of the statements may be the effect of the other statement. Read both statements and select the correct answer.<br/>I.Since the past three years, State M has reported a sharp and substantial decline in the state’s agricultural produce.<br/>II.In the last five years, there has been an increase in the overall average Rainfall by 6% in State M bringing respite to the farmers.</td>",
