                "question": "<td class=\"bold\" style=\"text-align: left;\" valign=\"top\">In this question, a question is followed by two statements numbered (I) and (II). You have to decide whether the data provided in the statement/s are sufficient to answer the question. Read both the statements and choose your answer carefully.<br/><br/>Question: P, Q, R, S, T, U and V are 7 people standing in a row all facing North (not necessarily in the same order). Who is standing second to the right of T?<br/><br/>Statements:<br/>(I) U is standing 3<sup>rd</sup> from the right end and 2<sup>nd</sup> to the left of R.<br/>(II) Q is standing to the immediate right of T. Q is standing 2<sup>nd</sup> to the left of P.</td>",
